#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1286 expect=skipped domain=TI
#note "TIVERS is absent, so Requirements.Variables.All gates the rule to SKIPPED. The sheet conditions this rule on TIVERS being present, so it is an applicability discriminator, not a defensive guard: with no criteria versions there is nothing to be unique within."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TI label="Trial Inclusion/Exclusion Criteria"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col IETESTCD type=Char label="Incl/Excl Criterion Short Name"
col IETEST   type=Char label="Incl/Excl Criterion"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | TI | INCL01 | Age >= 18
CDISCPILOT01 | TI | INCL01 | Age >= 21
---
